+    -   Binding 1: TextureView (`Voxel World`) [S3, unofficial].
+    -   Binding 2: Storage Buffer (`Grid Hierarchy`) [S3, unofficial].
+    -   Binding 3: TextureView (`Mip Texture`) [S3, unofficial].
+    -   Binding 4: Sampler (`Texture Sampler`) [S3, unofficial].
 
